---
import CommunityLayout from '../components/CommunityLayout.astro';
---

<CommunityLayout
  title="Terms of use | iDuckConvert"
  description="The simple rules for using iDuckConvert: free to use, you keep ownership of your files, and the tools are provided as they are."
  before="Terms of"
  mark="use"
  intro="Plain rules for a free tool. By using iDuckConvert you agree to them."
>
  <section class="card p-5" aria-labelledby="use">
    <h2 id="use" class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Using iDuckConvert</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">
      You may use the tools for personal or business work, free of charge. Please do not use the site to break the law, to
      process files you have no right to, or to try to disrupt or overload it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="card p-5" aria-labelledby="own">
    <h2 id="own" class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Your files stay yours</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">
      You keep all rights to the files you process. They are handled inside your browser and are not uploaded to us, so we
      get no rights to them.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="card p-5" aria-labelledby="asis">
    <h2 id="asis" class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">No guarantees</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">
      The tools are provided as they are. We work hard to make them correct, but we cannot promise they will always be
      available or free of mistakes. The tools save new files and do not change your originals, but always check a result
      before you rely on it. Exam and form requirements change, so compare our presets with the latest official notice, which
      each preset links to.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">
      To the extent the law allows, Basic App Company is not responsible for losses that come from using, or not being able to
      use, the site.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="card p-5" aria-labelledby="changes">
    <h2 id="changes" class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Changes and contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed">
      We may change these terms or the site. The date below shows the latest change. Questions? Use the
      <a class="link" href="/feedback/">feedback form</a>. See also our <a class="link" href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: 12 November 2026. Operated by Basic App Company.</p>
  </section>
</CommunityLayout>
